        "cooked": "<p>I have no idea why I have not posted here before, I must corrrect that!</p>\n<p>Do you like RPGs?</p>\n<p>Do you like&nbsp; action movies?</p>\n<p>Have you ever wanted to play as Chow Yun-Fat in the Killer, Bruce Lee in Enter the Dragon, Clint Eastwood in Dirty Harry, Mr Fixer in Rook City or Mel Gibson in Mad Max?</p>\n<p>Then Feng Shui is the game for you!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/atlasgames/feng-shui-2-action-movie-roleplaying-game-by-robin\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Feng Shui Kickstarter</a></p>\n<p>It's already made its funding goal (in 20 minutes) so it's not a gamble on if it funds or not.</p>",
